<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">Dear {!Contact.FirstName},&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">Thank you for signing a Maricopa to ASU Pathways Program agreement — your path to becoming a Sun Devil. Now that you are on a MAPP, you will know exactly which classes you need to complete to make a smooth transition to your desired major at Arizona State University.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">As a MAPP student, you have access to <a href="https://my.asu.edu/"><b><font color="#990000">My ASU</font></b></a> and ASU’s pathway tracker so you can track the progress of your transfer courses. You can access <a href="https://my.asu.edu/"><font color="#990000"><b>My ASU</b></font></a> directly by using your ASURITE UserID and password, or through <a href="https://my.maricopa.edu/"><b><font color="#990000">My Maricopa</font></b></a> by clicking on ASU Alliance. Once there, you can use the pathway tracker to review the classes you have left to complete your MAPP and transfer to ASU.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">If you have any questions about your MAPP, My ASU or transferring to ASU, please <b><a href="https://transfer.asu.edu/contact"><font color="#990000">contact your transfer specialist</font></a></b>. You can also schedule an appointment with your transfer specialist <b><a href="https://transfer.asu.edu/repallcalendar-node-field-avail-app-date/week"><font color="#990000">at your community college</font></a></b> or at an ASU campus during <b><a href="https://transfer.asu.edu/friday/week"><font color="#990000">Transfer Fridays</font></a></b>.</div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">Thank you,</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">{!User.FirstName}</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">Student Transfer Ambassador</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">transferambassadors@asu.edu</div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>